      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://grokipedia.com/page/bremen_kentucky"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "The area was known locally as the Dutch Settlement until at least 1840, populated by German-American pioneers.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
